- Changed the names of the files `fleetctl package` generates to `fleet-<platform>-<arch>-<fleet>.<ext>`, for example `fleet-macos-workstations.pkg`, `fleet-windows-arm64-workstations.msi`, and `fleet-linux-amd64.deb`. The fleet name is added when fleetctl is logged in to the server in `--fleet-url` and the enroll secret belongs to a fleet, followed by the fleet ID if another fleet's name would give the same file name. Scripts that expect `fleet-osquery*` file names need to be updated, or can choose the name with `--outfile`.
